   "body": "Seen again on mote, 2026-10-28, in a 17-file GUI run beside other sessions' suites (load ~50): `webkit zh: the tray panel's Usage tab` failed at panel-usage.test.cjs:427 (`settled`) with `asked: period=today&limit=1`. The window's filter check read the panel's own poll as the last request. The same file passed 66/66 together with two others on the rerun right after. Not taking it; the cause looks like the shared `asked` log this issue names.\n",
